    <item>
      <title>Version 1.1.1</title>
      <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 09:40:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>Quirky v1.1.1</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Switching to OCR or SVG mid-session now works: the selection used to be swallowed and the clipboard left untouched</li>
          <li>Shift+Tab cycles modes backward; Tab drops the picker so you can see where you landed</li>
        </ul>
